  "description_text": "Stay charged in style with Covertok. This ultra-slim 5000mAh/ 10000mAh power bank is designed for modern lifestyles – lightweight, sleek, and powerful. With its digital LED display, you always know your battery status. Perfectly pocket-sized, it ensures your devices never run out of power on the go. ✅ 5000mAh High Capacity – Enough to keep your devices powered all day. ✅ Slim & Stylish Design – Fits easily in your pocket or bag. ✅ Digital LED Display – Real-time battery percentage indicator. ✅ Fast Charging Output – Quick and efficient charging whenever you need it. ✅ Premium Build Quality – Durable, elegant, and made for everyday use. • 📱 Magnetic Attachment – Snaps onto your phone securely. • ⚡ Wireless Charging – Say goodbye to messy cables. 1-Month Warranty – your purchase is covered for any manufacturing defects",
